    "sub_name": "租稅規劃",
    "sub_ename": "TAX PLANNING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要闡述租稅規劃實務，使學生對租稅規劃及實務，能有一全盤而詳盡之瞭解。本課程的重點是應用租稅知識分析及處理涉稅事宜，以及瞭解可行租稅規劃方法，培養學生具有租稅規劃專業知識。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to introduce and interpret so that the students have a comprehensive and detailed of the understanding of tax planning practices. The focus of this course is apply taxation of knowledge to analyze and handling taxation matters, and understands feasible whys of tax planning. In order to the training of student's professional knowledge of tax planning.　",
